{
    "title": "Hair Tattoo: Barber Shop Game",
    "description": "Hair Tattoo: Barber Shop Game is a barber simulator and haircut game! Do you want to learn how to make cool hair cuts, shave n stuff? Join our barber shop and create hairstyles of any difficulty!\r\n\r\nClients will come to the barber shop with the desire to make a new hairstyle or piercing! Your task is to cut, shave, color, and style your hair with the highest quality so your client stays satisfied! If you mess up your hair, the client will leave in anger, and you won't get paid!\r\n\r\nYour barber shop will have all the necessary cutting tools you need to master!\r\nWith their help, you'll be able to create hair cut tattoos, change hair color, and hair styling!\r\n\r\nHair Tattoo: Barber Shop Game Features:\r\n\r\n- Beautiful 3D graphics\r\n- Unique mechanics\r\n- Simple controls\r\n- Plenty of cutting tools\r\n- Unusual hairstyle designs\r\n\r\nHair Tattoo: Barber Shop Game is a hair color changer and barber simulator where you can learn the art of hair cuts and upgrade your barber shop to the world level! Start working in the salon now and surprise your clients with new hairstyles!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Hair Tattoo: Barber Shop Game is a barber simulator and haircut game! Do you want to learn how to make cool hair cuts, shave n stuff? Join our barber shop and create hairstyles of any difficulty!<br><br>Clients will come to the barber shop with the desire to make a new hairstyle or piercing! Your task is to cut, shave, color, and style your hair with the highest quality so your client stays satisfied! If you mess up your hair, the client will leave in anger, and you won&#39;t get paid!<br><br>Your barber shop will have all the necessary cutting tools you need to master!<br>With their help, you&#39;ll be able to create hair cut tattoos, change hair color, and hair styling!<br><br>Hair Tattoo: Barber Shop Game Features:<br><br>- Beautiful 3D graphics<br>- Unique mechanics<br>- Simple controls<br>- Plenty of cutting tools<br>- Unusual hairstyle designs<br><br>Hair Tattoo: Barber Shop Game is a hair color changer and barber simulator where you can learn the art of hair cuts and upgrade your barber shop to the world level! Start working in the salon now and surprise your clients with new hairstyles!",
